A3059&#x27;/%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M8.5 3.5L3.5 8.5&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27;/%3e %3c/svg%3e" class="r-1l419pk" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="1c8acf9f-de54-4493-924e-b35c27729833" class="r-1d2iu6x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>UC Davis Study Found Toxic Micro-plastics in 25% of Wild Caught Seafood.*</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a2484ad3-579b-4361-956f-2532bddc1a5a" class="r-tylw5v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Protecting Key Spawning, Breeding, And Migratory Habitats Has Proven To Regenerate Biomass And Biodiversity</span></p></span></div><button data-rid="9c954aab-6cfd-408f-8582-a8f0389df2e0" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-11ugzqk alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="88c85a02-f89e-4c5a-9216-057fe9b0b0ca" class="r-lmjx4y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Shop Now</span></p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="d5966e94-7509-4841-9050-742e48da6637" class="r-1l1rjvv"><div data-rid="53ee7f60-b614-4493-bd30-c16602e47e68" class="r-foli1d"><div data-rid="a236acef-5c67-45d3-956c-5363d877ce76" class="r-1jd7wuq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>"Sourcing clean, sustainable seafood is often confusing. Seatopia's CSA model makes it fun and easy!"</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="d0d560d4-c3ff-4830-920b-a0d4c8b7fb1c" class="r-felf8n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>- Dr. Mark Hyman</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="d78cf9f8-02c3-46f1-8cd5-588b4ed42c07" class="r-i1j2l0"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/press-break.svg?v=1707650210" class="r-9zja5a" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="ee6da496-d0d6-4318-9949-a900ee6f9f22" class="r-1e2rpe6"><div data-rid="7065402f-3e2a-4bb4-9d09-a6fec0cecb0c" class="r-1lq354y"><div data-rid="86dcf4dc-3321-4494-979d-17d9511042de" class="r-13c3rqx"><div data-rid="76ca05b1-0b80-40c3-a623-f2b13909ef82" class="r-191k7tf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Philosophy</p></span></div><div data-rid="9f300894-5b19-42ad-951f-ade94941dc99" class="r-1lfkdko alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>We shouldn't have to choose between unsustainable practices and high-levels of mercury in wild fish or high-levels of antibiotics in farmed fish.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="44d84c86-46e7-4133-aa64-a1b856107cab" class="r-120quz2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Every lot harvested for SEATOPIA has a Certificate of Analysis (COA) quantifying cleanliness and levels of heavy metals. We guarantee everything we package is certified to have less than 0.1 PPM of mercury.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="15e98bf4-9aef-4abe-ae58-39bd762b71b0" class="r-1bl1kt9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Furthermore every farm is audited and third-party certified for sustainable farming practices from Best Aquaculture Practices (BAP) and or Aquaculture Stewardship Council (ASC).</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="0a752fed-ea9b-4419-bfa6-7eef67b1211a" class="r-9dosv1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>If you care where your food comes from and want the best quality seafood at home, you've come to the right place.</span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="6b2c7c7e-cce9-43a9-896e-206b917adccb" class="r-afj41p"><picture data-rid="f324e8a3-c571-4ee2-a333-0feae85ed4d0" class="r-u1vbws"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/JamesAndDaniella_SeatopiaFounders_1.jpg?v=1707656197&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/JamesAndDaniella_SeatopiaFounders_1.jpg?v=1707656197&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/JamesAndDaniella_SeatopiaFounders_1.jpg?v=1707656197&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/JamesAndDaniella_SeatopiaFounders_1.jpg?v=1707656197" class="r-1t8tos" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div></div><div data-rid="abf630e5-b921-44a7-a2d6-135d76a08601" class="r-nnbhyy"><div data-rid="b4ed34c6-3a08-4ed7-8523-81a260b0e5b5" class="r-1ejbjld"><picture data-rid="7cd8931a-ece6-4c3d-a417-ba717c374591" class="r-dvem5y"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447" class="r-3xlyde" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="882aace0-dbd0-4c1e-b4db-dd11434737c8" class="r-140ha5d"><style>

