<div class="klaviyo-form-XvBPTm"></div></div><picture data-rid="854404a7-5896-48fe-aad8-95aa5f7986ac" class="r-1ynujqx"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Mask_group_3bd45ef7-e1ab-4cab-aba9-6b197702e109.png?v=1707637447" class="r-6bc55l" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="c25f9a86-7423-477c-afb3-273717b5c090" class="r-9gi88o"><div data-rid="f3cda108-6ec2-43b9-bf0c-597364c9205d" class="r-rgolpx"><div data-rid="e35e7a83-2b31-485c-b694-ef68b7230f84" class="r-17vnqz5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>FAQ</p></span></div><div data-rid="6355dbc2-1538-4806-9e13-1b9ca8578f70" class="r-1rc372y" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="47d55d59-56c7-4869-94ed-738c1b621523" class="r-11vfio2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="05fa920b-a52b-4fd2-aa84-c21baa461f81" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R6cb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-c0i7vf r-1f1czu6"><div data-rid="60829dd2-6137-472e-9a46-37a0027d09c2" class="r-142n7rw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">IS MY SEAFOOD FRESH OR FROZEN?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="39e7acd6-04d2-4668-9623-5d7086ebec0e" class="r-dpylh r-x1aqd8"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1estd78 r-fqzj4b" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7A.5.5 0 0 1 4 8"></path></svg></div></div><div id="replo-:R6cb2:" aria-controls="replo-:R6cb2:" aria-expanded="true"><div data-rid="75629022-e4df-44d6-9ac3-b0cdd3491c98" class="r-cvzi5t"><div data-rid="727dfb43-8ac6-4f23-9ff7-077712f25e64" class="r-1esrc6n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Your seafood will be </span><em>super</em><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">-</span><em>frozen</em><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)"> with liquid nitrogen at peak freshness to lock in its flavor, nutrients and texture until you're ready to enjoy it. Unlike seafood at the grocery store that can be sitting out for unknown lengths of time or thawed on arrival - gradually degrading in quality and flavor until it’s purchased.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3184f57a-1cd2-48c6-882e-e4b9710af174" class="r-1te7bvj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="af90ee76-86e0-48f6-b7ed-2025e3330506" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Racb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-lojz0t"><div data-rid="6846102c-6d0d-48fc-8d2b-b506922bfb58" class="r-1wlls9n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">DO I HAVE TO BE HOME FOR DELIVERY?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="a58e1830-03f4-4a86-b637-7afe0afb7e20" class="r-1k6mb3x"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1aykj0h" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Racb2:" aria-controls="replo-:Racb2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="12d5a624-8451-4914-9719-65d3b9f7b9bb" class="r-iuarj7"><div data-rid="e429a3f2-05a5-4860-9adb-ba7f1b7ac843" class="r-1u59wj3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="35cd548d-9a62-4ff9-beda-36a7542efb56" class="r-172qh01" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="dd7734f6-94a0-46bc-8709-44ee3a257857" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Recb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1t5eenz"><div data-rid="fe8431f9-45d8-43b4-9080-f5a540aa2c44" class="r-wr5te2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">WHY A MEMBERSHIP?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="21911040-eaf4-4ea1-8852-4a80c5faefe7" class="r-1ju2m4c"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1mm84jh" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Recb2:" aria-controls="replo-:Recb2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="2e275bdf-7c4d-4c97-adf3-c864305265c6" class="r-kuksbp"><div data-rid="898109cd-9e26-43ed-b7b6-14df91b9a8d1" class="r-1qoec50 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6adaa98b-7db8-4fc9-ac07-b6d77c793e3a" class="r-l6br0u" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0cbb10be-f35a-401a-8005-5d8b27c981e4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Ricb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1yvlqo3"><div data-rid="473eb212-ce7a-4a5a-a2b9-da0a915abf8a" class="r-18spt0f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">WHY CHOOSE FARMED INSTEAD OF WILD-CAUGHT</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="d0f7d42c-e2cd-47da-b683-edf98047eb36" class="r-1bd0cfh"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1x4h9hg" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ricb2:" aria-controls="replo-:Ricb2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="87a3e3aa-cd0a-42d7-9382-fe204e82c1e3" class="r-pjxvcj"><div data-rid="e4f9819b-3b51-4c82-81da-bf2755f20178" class="r-d3vkxm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">At Seatopia, we go to great lengths to ensure that our seafood is of the highest quality, both in terms of nutritional value and sustainability. Here's why our farm-raised options are an excellent choice:</span><br><br><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</span><br><br><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</span><br><br><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</span><br><br><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</span><br><br><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</span><br><br><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. </span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://seatopia.fish/blogs/seatopia-collective-community/seatopia-featured-on-the-drs-farmacy-with-dr-mark-hyman">Learn more.</a></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1fd1e8ee-c423-4362-a418-a2ca93d0f8cb" class="r-ie2xl0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0ef95ccd-072f-4b5f-a3b3-5acc7fc8c0ab" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rmcb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-187n1pw"><div data-rid="563c068d-a7a4-468a-b5bf-70132de67607" class="r-1k0bmoo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">CAN I SKIP OR CANCEL?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="520435e1-4791-4987-828b-36c5937f391a" class="r-6mghz8"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1unussz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rmcb2:" aria-controls="replo-:Rmcb2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="1691d45a-3562-4dcb-afa7-3979793ed0ff" class="r-ftx7bg"><div data-rid="19e6a51e-44aa-4b66-8b76-e57c357dcea2" class="r-jqq6t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(27, 48, 89)">Yes. You can adjust your delivery schedule, plan type, frequency and even cancel completely through your online account portal. If you'd prefer, chat with us and we'll help customize your Membership to meet your exact preferences and schedule.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="9fff91f0-9718-4e1f-8c31-53831b6c3d0b" class="r-13yi55r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><br></p></span></div><div data-rid="c302a230-2a98-4b2c-be84-17d8224a40d6" class="r-1skvuqd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div></div><button data-rid="d4e34406-7e87-4906-879a-81f5c43439b6" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-9g63wa alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="a58b2e52-8c8a-4dbc-9b30-d63845390034" class="r-1ktya0h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Shop Now</span></p></span></div></button></div><picture data-rid="897965c4-580b-458e-af99-842135e5adb8" class="r-7xfjf9"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/faq-break.svg?v=1707651699" class="r-7j4f4j" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="19e610b6-43fe-4135-bf5f-81a